    "summary": "One Harpy per turn can use Spore Mine Cysts when the Fight phase ends. Choose a visible enemy within 24″ of the Harpy, excluding Lone Operatives. Roll six D6 and deal 1 mortal wound to that enemy per 3+. As an alternative, add a unit of D3 SPORE MINES within 6″ of the Harpy, staying more than 8″ horizontally from every enemy unit.",
